---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
export const prerender=true;
---
<Layout title="Trailer user manuals"><section class="page-head"><div class="wrap"><div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>User manuals</span></div><p class="eyebrow">OWNER RESOURCES</p><h1>Find the information for your trailer.</h1><p>Manuals and model-specific documents are matched to the confirmed product and order reference.</p></div></section><div class="wrap prose"><h2>Request the correct document</h2><p>Supply the model name, order reference and trailer identification details. This avoids relying on instructions prepared for a different rating or configuration.</p><div class="support-grid"><article class="support-card"><h2>Safe towing</h2><p>Review coupling, chains, plug connection, braking, loading and towing-vehicle requirements.</p></article><article class="support-card"><h2>Loading</h2><p>Follow the approved ratings, load distribution and restraint instructions for the specific trailer.</p></article><article class="support-card"><h2>Maintenance</h2><p>Keep inspection and service records with the trailer documents.</p></article></div><a class="button" href="/quote/">Request a manual →</a></div></Layout>
